  "id": "chickpea-spinach-and-almond-butter-bowl",
  "name": "Chickpea, Spinach, and Almond Butter Bowl",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced chickpea bowl with greens and rice",
  "description": "Chickpeas simmer with aromatic spices, almond butter, and spinach for a hearty plant-based meal served over rice.",
